{"3677620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DuoQ", "steam_appid": 3677620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A 2-Player Game, Played Entirely in Singleplayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DuoQ is an <strong>e-dating sim </strong>about<strong> romancing another person in an online game</strong>. Play alongside Tala, a mysterious stranger met in the fictional FPS game <i>To the Heart</i>. With Tala at your side, you'll solve co-op challenges, learn about her  IRL life, and answer the question: is she into you?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk with Tala using your real voice, with open ended conversations, a rich narrative to uncover, and plenty of flirting to do!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome multiplayer-like challenges and puzzles, fully playable in single player</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover collectibles, secrets, and multiple distinct endings</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >...So is this a Multiplayer Game?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nope! DuoQ uses voice recognition to track your conversation with Tala, allowing for real time conversations and history. Tala isn't a real person, but using these new technologies, we can tell a new kind of story through the structure of a multiplayer game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plus, nothing in DuoQ is AI Generated. We use  machine learning to advance the conversation, but we don't use AI to generate voice lines, art, or the story itself. This is a handcrafted game and a labor of love from our team - enjoy!</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A 2-Player Game, Played Entirely in Singleplayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DuoQ is an <strong>e-dating sim </strong>about<strong> romancing another person in an online game</strong>. Play alongside Tala, a mysterious stranger met in the fictional FPS game <i>To the Heart</i>. With Tala at your side, you'll solve co-op challenges, learn about her  IRL life, and answer the question: is she into you?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk with Tala using your real voice, with open ended conversations, a rich narrative to uncover, and plenty of flirting to do!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome multiplayer-like challenges and puzzles, fully playable in single player</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover collectibles, secrets, and multiple distinct endings</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >...So is this a Multiplayer Game?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nope! DuoQ uses voice recognition to track your conversation with Tala, allowing for real time conversations and history. Tala isn't a real person, but using these new technologies, we can tell a new kind of story through the structure of a multiplayer game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plus, nothing in DuoQ is AI Generated. We use  machine learning to advance the conversation, but we don't use AI to generate voice lines, art, or the story itself. This is a handcrafted game and a labor of love from our team - enjoy!</p>", "short_description": "Squad up with Tala, a mysterious (and flirty!) player you meet in the lobby of a fictional FPS game. Use your real-life voice to talk with Tala over comms, solve puzzles, and outwit enemies. By the end, you’ll answer the most important question: Is she into you?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677620/d2a3bbe107d10894669380ecb02d825bf0afda5c/header.jpg?t=1748630997", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677620/70da8ed795f89931ea2a7956c37a86f8953174f1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748630997", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677620/70da8ed795f89931ea2a7956c37a86f8953174f1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748630997", "website": "https://duoqgame.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5 12th Gen<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Dedicated GPU required for voice transcription</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i7 12th Gen<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 2070<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "legal_notice": "Copyright 2025 The Duo Crew", "developers": ["The Duo Crew"], "publishers": ["USC Games"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 72, "description": "Chat Speech-to-text"}, {"id": 68, "description": "Custom Volume Controls"}, {"id": 74, "description": "Playable without Timed Input"}, {"id": 69, "description": "Stereo Sound"}, {"id": 23, "description": "Steam Cloud"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "37", "description": "Free To Play"}], "scree